    "oterm_name": "comment"
   },
   "value": {
    "scalar_type": "string",
    "string_value": "Sediment core taken during the installation of well FW-305 (Oak Ridge FRC, Background A; well completed 2013-05-29), 54 sections from 0.5 to 26.08 ft below ground surface. Measured by the Elias Lab (ORNL); workbook by Kathryn Bailey, 2013-08-02"
   }
  },
  {
   "value_type": {
    "term_name": "comment",
    "oterm_ref": "ME:0000011",
    "oterm_name": "comment"
   },
   "value": {
    "scalar_type": "string",
    "string_value": "Anions and organic acids by ion chromatography, micromolar as given in the workbook. Iron(2+) and iron(3+) are mg of iron per g of soil. Moisture content is percent"
   }
  },
  {
   "value_type": {
    "term_name": "comment",
    "oterm_ref": "ME:0000011",
    "oterm_name": "comment"
   },
   "value": {
    "scalar_type": "string",
    "string_value": "Where the workbook leaves an anion or organic acid cell empty, the analyte was not detected in that section: the concentration is blank and the below variable of that analyte is true. The workbook gives no detection limits; every section has values from the same ion chromatography run. Butyrate and citrate were not detected in any section. Formate of FW305-01-36 is blank with below false: the workbook has 6969, a typing error with no recoverable value (all other formate values are 0.03 to 6.95)"
   }
  },
  {
   "value_type": {
    "term_name": "comment",
    "oterm_ref": "ME:0000011",
    "oterm_name": "comment"
   },
   "value": {
    "scalar_type": "string",
    "string_value": "Source: ENIGMA Google Drive, IC Analysis of Core.xlsx. The workbook's injection number (order of the instrument runs) is not stored"
   }
  }
 ],
